1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,410
I can’t tell my family what I want without feeling
ungrateful.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,475
For adults facing family pressure, this starts in private.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,915
Find words for a boundary you choose.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,100
Possible themes are a prepared mock-up, not generated.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,460
Planned Muse Spark could organize possibilities for review.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,800
No model is connected. Arjun shares what he wants to explore.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,785
The local reply is only a prepared possibility.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,165
Arjun chooses Not quite.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,770
He changes partner to parents and asks for time.

10
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,335
The reflection changes with his edited words.

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,605
He confirms what feels closer.

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,800
He keeps one next step private: I can ask for time before
deciding.

13
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,835
Only then does he choose whether peer experience could help.

14
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,260
Day four: a fictional peer describes a different experience.

15
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,260
That perspective can add context without choosing for him.

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,630
Day nine: the fictional host sets a boundary.

17
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,180
I can listen. I can’t decide for you.

18
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,425
A prepared triage example sends no report.

19
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,625
Day sixteen: Dev’s question stays unanswered.

20
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,140
No reply is promised.

21
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,940
Arjun edits one question for Ravi.

22
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,605
The exact group preview names the audience and alias.

23
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:54,270
Ravi accepts group replies only, never a private message.

24
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:59,585
Private conversation is excluded. Consent stays unchecked.

25
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,955
Nothing is sent. No provider is verified or bookable here.

26
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:09,185
He returns to the peer story, with his own choice intact.

27
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,535
His takeaway is kept in this preview session only.

28
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:18,755
Maybe later leaves any contribution optional.

29
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,460
He drafts one bounded thought he could offer Dev.

30
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:28,120
It is local, fictional and unsent.

31
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:34,330
The optional group draft leaves his private conversation out.

32
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:38,725
Consent is unchecked. Posting is disabled.

33
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:42,590
No send action is connected.

34
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,320
Arjun keeps the next step in his hands.

35
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,935
I can ask for time before deciding.

36
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,560
He keeps his takeaway private. Nothing is sent.
